From: Agent Browser contributors
Subject: [PATCH] Allow DNS-only hints over explicitly managed strict proxy DoH

Preserve the default fixed-proxy DNS skip and every preloading gate. Only an
embedder with validated, configured managed secure DNS may opt DNS-only jobs
into the existing resolver path. Keep socket preconnects unchanged. The
existing managed resolver enforces secure-only DNS and proxy forwarding.

This is not a per-site rule and does not alter page findings or GPU identity.
Native compilation, DNS route verification and real-page acceptance remain
separate requirements; source policy tests do not establish runtime success.

